ss220-objective-issuer-ambition = [color=pink]Personal ambitions[/color]

ss220-ambition-strong-diet-name = Strict diet
ss220-ambition-strong-diet-desc = Because of !REASON!, I decided that I would only eat !FOOD!.

ss220-ambition-cookism-name = Conservatism in food
ss220-ambition-cookism-desc = I can only cook !FOOD!, and that is clearly my calling. I will not be cooking any other food in the coming years.

ss220-ambition-mania-name = Obsession
ss220-ambition-item-mania-desc = Because !REASON!, I've been dreaming about owning !ITEM! for a long time...
ss220-ambition-abstract-mania-desc = I love !TOPIC!! I want as much of it as possible in my life.
ss220-ambition-species-mania-desc = !SPECIES! are the best species in the world!

ss220-ambition-job-gift-name = Charity event
ss220-ambition-job-gift-desc = I must give !ITEM! to every !JOB!!

ss220-ambition-become-rich-name = Making money
ss220-ambition-become-rich-desc = I plan to earn at least !COUNT! credits!

ss220-ambition-location-love-name = Dreams about home
ss220-ambition-location-love-desc = !LOCATION! is the best place in the world. I want to live there.

ss220-ambition-bard-soul-name = Bard's Soul
ss220-ambition-bard-soul-desc = I dream of performing in public, playing songs and entertaining people.

ss220-ambition-alcoholic-name = Alcoholic
ss220-ambition-alcoholic-desc = I can't resist drinking. Need to have another glass.

ss220-ambition-food-critic-name = Food Critic
ss220-ambition-food-critic-desc = I'm a renowned food critic. I must evaluate every dish.

ss220-ambition-word-of-honor-name = Word of Honor
ss220-ambition-word-of-honor-desc = I promise myself to never lie!

ss220-ambition-liar-name = Liar
ss220-ambition-liar-desc = Can I manage to never tell the truth?

ss220-ambition-hoarder-name = Compulsive Hoarder
ss220-ambition-hoarder-desc = I need my own personal corner where I can store EVERYTHING. In general, any items might be useful in the future, so I'll take them for myself.

ss220-ambition-drama-master-name = Drama Master
ss220-ambition-drama-master-desc = I want to attract as much attention as possible by faking some kind of accident.

ss220-ambition-befriend-name = Friendship
ss220-ambition-befriend-desc = I want to become close friends with !NAME!.

ss220-ambition-enemy-name = Hidden Animosity
ss220-ambition-enemy-desc = !NAME! seriously wronged me in the past, and I don't even want to see them. They can go to hell.

ss220-ambition-date-name = Romantic Date
ss220-ambition-date-desc = I want to arrange a date with !NAME! where we romantically eat !FOOD!...

ss220-ambition-profession-change-name = Career Change
ss220-ambition-profession-change-desc = I'm not satisfied with who I am. I believe if I become a !JOB!, my life will be much better.

ss220-ambition-manipulator-name = Manipulator
ss220-ambition-manipulator-quarrel-desc = Can I make !NAME1! and !NAME2! fight with each other?
ss220-ambition-manipulator-friend-desc = Can I make !NAME1! and !NAME2! become close friends?

ss220-ambition-support-name = Support
ss220-ambition-support-desc = Because of !REASON!, I would like !NAME! to be okay.

ss220-ambition-story-collector-name = Story Collector
ss220-ambition-story-collector-desc = I'm writing a book of memories. I need to learn the most interesting life story from !COUNT! different people.

ss220-ambition-secret-benefactor-name = Secret Benefactor
ss220-ambition-secret-benefactor-desc = Today I will anonymously help !NAME!. They must not find out it's me.

ss220-ambition-unusual-collector-name = Collector of the Unusual
ss220-ambition-unusual-collector-desc = I collect rare items. Today I need to find !COUNT! copies of !ITEM!.

ss220-ambition-interior-designer-name = Interior Designer
ss220-ambition-interior-designer-desc = !LOCATION! looks terrible. I must decorate it and make it cozy.

ss220-ambition-peacemaker-name = Peacemaker
ss220-ambition-peacemaker-desc = I cannot stand conflicts. If I see a quarrel, I will definitely try to reconcile those arguing.

ss220-ambition-paranoidal-name = Paranoid
ss220-ambition-paranoidal-desc = I'm sure everyone around me is lying to me!

ss220-ambition-innocent-soul-name = Naive Soul
ss220-ambition-innocent-soul-desc = I take everything at face value! People can't lie to me, can they?

ss220-ambition-hoverboard-name = Personal Transport
ss220-ambition-hoverboard-desc = I want my own skateboard and a safe place to ride it on the station.

ss220-ambition-hoverboard-race-name = Racer
ss220-ambition-hoverboard-race-desc = I want to arrange a safe skateboard race with !NAME!.

ss220-ambition-safety-name = Safety protocol
ss220-ambition-safety-desc = I must make sure every crew member has an emergency oxygen tank and a suitable breathing mask.

ss220-ambition-suspicion-name = Suspicion
ss220-ambition-suspicion-desc = I'm convinced that !NAME! is a criminal, but I can't prove it.

ss220-ambition-harsh-commander-name = Harsh commander
ss220-ambition-harsh-commander-desc = My subordinates must obey me without question or they will be dismissed.

ss220-ambition-kind-commander-name = The Kindest Leader
ss220-ambition-kind-commander-desc = Everyone deserves a second chance. My kind words will surely convince others not to repeat their mistakes.

ss220-ambition-gluttony-name = Deadly Sin: Gluttony
ss220-ambition-gluttony-desc = Delicious food is the best thing in this world. If I die, it should be from overeating.

ss220-ambition-faked-death-name = Death Staging
ss220-ambition-faked-death-desc = Everyone must believe that I am dead.

ss220-ambition-extremist-name = Extreme Enthusiast
ss220-ambition-extremist-desc = I live for thrills. I want to take part in a safe zero-gravity training session.

ss220-ambition-thief-vengeance-name = It's Personal
ss220-ambition-thief-vengeance-desc = Poor !NAME! got in my way in the past - I won't tolerate it. I'll take away everything dear to him. I'll leave him in his pants alone. Literally.

ss220-ambition-thief-carcat-mischief-name = Feline Mischief
ss220-ambition-thief-carcat-mischief-desc = I love watching things fall. I want to secretly nudge other people's trinkets off shelves and tables.

ss220-ambition-thief-lair-name = My Lair
ss220-ambition-thief-lair-desc = Because !REASON!, I must set up my lair in !LOCATION!.

ss220-ambition-thief-carrin-magpie-name = Magpie
ss220-ambition-thief-carrin-magpie-desc = I love shiny things so much. I want to collect a big collection of different shiny things.

ss220-ambition-thief-blind-justice-name = Blind Justice
ss220-ambition-thief-blind-justice-desc = I want the rich to get richer and the poor to get poorer.

ss220-ambition-fashionista-name = Fashionista
ss220-ambition-fashionista-desc = I want to be dressed in the latest fashion.

ss220-ambition-nesting-name = Nesting
ss220-ambition-nesting-desc = I want to build a cozy nest in the living quarters, preferably with some company.

ss220-ambition-science-curiosity-name = Scientific Interest
ss220-ambition-science-curiosity-desc = I want to study the scientific theory about !DISCOVERY!

ss220-ambition-forbidden-knowledge-name = Forbidden Knowledge
ss220-ambition-forbidden-knowledge-desc = Because !REASON!, I consider the technology "!DISCOVERY!" dangerous. I will try to persuade the science department not to develop it.

ss220-ambition-enlightener-name = Enlightener
ss220-ambition-enlightener-desc = I believe EVERYONE should learn about the secrets of !DISCOVERY!.
